RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 that middle ran 157% of normal in May to June and 49% in November to December. For 2026, March to April came in at 62% and June to July at 95% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
